SUMMARY:Park at Flat Rock\; a walk
DESCRIPTION:Hendo Fun Friends\n**A WALK IN THE PARK**\nThis Week: The Park
  at Flat Rock**.**\n**Description:**\nthe 66-acre park has a flat\, open g
 reen space and a 1.3 mile trail (shortcuts available) that you can walk or
  run.\nhttps://flatrockparkfoundation.org/the-park/\nDifficulty: Easy\, pe
 asy\nSuitable for beginners? Yes\nWe are the Sloth Walking Team: “We wil
 l get there when we get there.”\n**Up to 12 ppl** are welcome to join us
 .\n**https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Bsh_8qxUfDY**\nLength: <1.5 mi\; Tota
 l ascent: 25 ft\nApprx return time: 11 AM\nOptional: Some will walk 2 laps
 …\n**Optional:** Lunch @ TBD. (Treskas??)\n**This is a dog-participant w
 alk.** This event is NOT for those who are uncomfortable with the antics o
 f fun-loving dogs. Dogs are welcome (IF their masters are well trained). '
 On leash' rules apply.\nWeather Check: Hendersonville\, NC\nAll walks are 
 at your own risk. You are responsible for your OWN safety and adequate equ
 ipment.\nWaiver: There are certain risks inherent in any outdoor activity.
  Each participant\, by signing up to attend this event\, agrees to release
  from liability the leader(s)\, Hendo Fun Friends\, its Partners\, Affilia
 tes\, and members for any accident\, injury\, illness\, or personal loss w
 hich might occur while participating in this activity or while traveling i
 n any vehicle during this trip. Each participant further agrees to abide b
 y the rules and regulations concerning safety\, to follow instructions of 
 the leader(s)\, and not to become intentionally separated from the group. 
 The leader(s) also has the right to use any images collected on this trip 
 for recording on website photo collections.\ngordie's contact: CurmudgeonH
 iker@gmail.com\n(**before** day of hike): 828.393.0297 (text only)\n**Pics
 : https://www.flickr.com/photos/146993931@N05/albums**
