SUMMARY:FYI: Olde Fashioned Christmas
DESCRIPTION:Hendo Fun Friends\nJoin for an olde fashioned open house with 
 all downtown Hendersonville’s wonderful assortment of destination shops\
 , family-friendly entertainment and fabulous eateries!\nTake a magical rid
 e through Historic Downtown Hendersonville among its twinkling lights and 
 festive decorations. The serpentine street adds to the leisurely pace of t
 he horse\, so you can slow down and savor the moment\nHenderson County Par
 ks and Recreation will accompany the event with Santa on the Square. It wi
 ll include selfies with Santa\, hot cocoa\, games\, crafts\, specials gues
 ts and more. Santa on the Square will be hosted in front of the Historic C
 ourthouse in Downtown Hendersonville.
